      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source first.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability: remove unused imports, add brief comments to clarify each group of assertions, and make the platform-dependent assertion more self-documenting.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed 11 unused imports, added inline comments grouping and explaining each of the three `IOCase` variants (SENSITIVE, INSENSITIVE, SYSTEM), and clarified the platform-dependent `WINDOWS` constant with a brief comment about its meaning."
